-- Read alone, definition 5 makes the start date the first day of the CURRENT period. Then a
-- surgery ordered in 2025, on a contract held continuously since 2023, is a "surgical
-- indication that existed before the start date" in 2026, and a special disease treated in
-- 2026 falls in "the first year" again.
GIVEN i IS AN `An item of a claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`exclusion 12, with definition 5's start date, applies to` i MEANS
        NOT (`the schedule of` i)'s `extended to cover pre-existing conditions`
    AND CONSIDER (`the event of` i)'s `the date the surgery was first ordered`
        WHEN JUST d  THEN d LESS THAN `the start date as definition 5 alone reads it, of` (`the policy of` i)
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

GIVEN i IS AN `An item of a claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`exclusion 26, with definition 5's start date, applies to` i MEANS
        (`the line of` i)'s `the date` LESS THAN `add years` (`the start date as definition 5 alone reads it, of` (`the policy of` i)) 1
    AND any (GIVEN c YIELD c `is a special disease within definition 19`) ((`the event of` i)'s `the conditions diagnosed`)

`the contract held since 2023` MEANS `a policy renewed continuously since 2023 on` `the full schedule`

`an illness whose surgery was ordered in June 2025` MEANS
    `The event` WITH `the cause` IS `an illness`, `the accident` IS NOTHING, `the illness` IS JUST `the standard illness`, `the conditions diagnosed` IS (LIST `a condition the Rules do not name`), `the circumstances` IS EMPTY, `the sporting activity` IS NOTHING, `the hospital stay` IS JUST `the standard stay`, `the date of death` IS NOTHING, `the cause of death unknown` IS FALSE, `the disablement` IS NOTHING, `the date the surgery was first ordered` IS JUST (YMD 2025 6 1), `the date of the outpatient diagnosis` IS NOTHING

`hepatitis in March 2026` MEANS
    `an illness, with diagnoses` (LIST `hepatitis`) `and circumstances` EMPTY `, and the standard stay`

`the claim for the surgery ordered in 2025` MEANS
    `a claim by` `the insured person` `under` `the contract held since 2023` `for` `an illness whose surgery was ordered in June 2025` `with the lines` (LIST `a clean benefit 1 line`)

`the claim for hepatitis` MEANS
    `a claim by` `the insured person` `under` `the contract held since 2023` `for` `hepatitis in March 2026` `with the lines` (LIST `a clean benefit 1 line`)

`a surgery ordered in 2025, on a contract held since 2023` MEANS
    `the line` `a clean benefit 1 line` `in` `the claim for the surgery ordered in 2025`

`hepatitis in 2026, on a contract held since 2023` MEANS
    `the line` `a clean benefit 1 line` `in` `the claim for hepatitis`

#ASSERT `exclusion 12, with definition 5's start date, applies to` `a surgery ordered in 2025, on a contract held since 2023`
#ASSERT NOT (`exclusion 12 applies to` `a surgery ordered in 2025, on a contract held since 2023`)
#ASSERT `exclusion 26, with definition 5's start date, applies to` `hepatitis in 2026, on a contract held since 2023`
#ASSERT NOT (`exclusion 26 applies to` `hepatitis in 2026, on a contract held since 2023`)

