    OR  (    i `involves` `a vaccination needed after an accident or an insect or animal bite`
         AND NOT (`the benefit of` i EQUALS `benefit 4: newborn care`))

`a rabies vaccination` MEANS
    `a line under` `Programme I: medical expenses for an accidental injury` `for` `medicines` `on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `of` 1_000_000 `involving` (LIST `a vaccination needed after an accident or an insect or animal bite`)

`the claim for a dog bite` MEANS
    `a claim by` `the insured person` `under` `the standard policy` `for` `the standard accident event` `with the lines` EMPTY

`a rabies vaccination after a dog bite` MEANS
    `the line` `a rabies vaccination` `in` `the claim for a dog bite`

#ASSERT `exclusion 9, read literally, applies to` `a rabies vaccination after a dog bite`
#ASSERT NOT (`exclusion 9 applies to` `a rabies vaccination after a dog bite`)

